      "versionNonce": 2040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key Implementation Details:\n  - 9 of 40 supplements have Shopify variant IDs embedded in purchaseUrl\n  - Variant IDs: Omega-3, Mg-Threonate, L-Theanine, Zinc, Vit D3, B-Complex, L-Tyrosine, Bacopa, Saffron\n  - Checkboxes disabled/hidden for rows without purchaseUrl\n  - Select-all only selects currently filtered items that have a purchaseUrl\n  - Cart permalink format: https://www.swansonvitamins.com/cart/VARIANT_ID:QTY,VARIANT_ID:QTY\n  - No API key needed — pure URL construction, opens in new browser tab\n  - Quantity defaults to 1 per item",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Implementation Details:\n  - 9 of 40 supplements have Shopify variant IDs embedded in purchaseUrl\n  - Variant IDs: Omega-3, Mg-Threonate, L-Theanine, Zinc, Vit D3, B-Complex, L-Tyrosine, Bacopa, Saffron\n  - Checkboxes disabled/hidden for rows without purchaseUrl\n  - Select-all only selects currently filtered items that have a purchaseUrl\n  - Cart permalink format: https://www.swansonvitamins.com/cart/VARIANT_ID:QTY,VARIANT_ID:QTY\n  - No API key needed — pure URL construction, opens in new browser tab\n  - Quantity defaults to 1 per item",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
